OL,3,GNEWSA'Dark day for Lewis' as one
OL,4,Afisherman dead and two missing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say a body has been found in the
OL,7,Fsearch for three men who were onboard a
OL,8,Ffishing boat that has gone missing off
OL,9,Fthe Western Isles.
OL,11,FThe Maritime and Coastguard Agency
OL,12,F(MCA) said the alarm was raised at
OL,13,Fabout 21:20 on Tuesday when it emerged
OL,14,Fthe boat was overdue from Lewis.
OL,16,FA plane, two helicopters, two lifeboats
OL,17,Fand volunteers were making searches off
OL,18,Fthe Port of Ness in north Lewis. Police
OL,19,Fhave warned the public not to make
OL,20,Ftheir own searches due to bad weather.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
